 "questionType": "단답형",
 "content": "다음 식을 계산하시오.\n⑴ $(3a-2b)+(-a+6b)$ ⑵ $(-2x+7y)-(6x-y)$\n⑶ $(5a-2b+1)-2(a+3b-4)$ ⑷ $3(2x-y-3)-(8x-5y+2)$",
 "choices": [],
 "answer": "⑴ $2a+4b$ ⑵ $-8x+8y$\n⑶ $3a-8b+9$ ⑷ $-2x+2y-11$",
 "solution": "⑴ $3a-a-2b+6b=2a+4b$이다.\n⑵ $-2x+7y-6x+y=-8x+8y$이다.\n⑶ $5a-2b+1-2a-6b+8=3a-8b+9$이다.\n⑷ $6x-3y-9-8x+5y-2=-2x+2y-11$이다.",
